            <div xml:id="m-0ddd5742-ac5d-42b9-b5b2-89103d3ca010">
              <lg xml:id="m-c81cc0a5-1399-42a7-9b2f-01988abf5310">
                <l xml:id="m-e5e5ca95-3834-4b28-93da-e3bb6e3f000b" facs="#m-b240a7ef-323a-480e-9022-45b0756692e7" label="text-like">Common of a Martyr not a Bishop. Mass. I.</l><l xml:id="m-c4a42a06-d086-4682-a22b-b5459fb5c31b" facs="#m-b494b700-2e30-43b8-906a-9a378fab0d9e" label="ambiguous">1137</l><l xml:id="m-451ce78b-55cf-47c8-bcbe-045f2c08bf6a" facs="#m-b9dce884-acc4-445a-bebc-c1def800b256" label="lyrics-like">é-rit</l><l xml:id="m-947887c7-4b25-4725-bfef-aaed0bb741f0" facs="#m-fea30dd8-baa6-4cf7-b0d1-0f2139384380" label="lyrics-like">sé- men é¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c04d346-97e4-4f3d-885f-9bea406092b7" facs="#m-e1644954-d295-4fa9-8ddd-7f04b6755aa4" label="lyrics-like">rectó¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8d67ec3-31b4-442c-a960-d3018c5a96e8" facs="#m-2559452b-94e3-472d-a652-6c64fa8dc9c0" label="lyrics-like">jus: gene-rá-ti¬ o</l><l xml:id="m-567cbe13-158c-4e4a-ac4a-8a4dd344970f" facs="#m-8f80df04-c32b-4259-84f3-f5e3187ef464" label="lyrics-like">rum“ benedi- cé-tur.</l><l xml:id="m-99f7b479-1475-4791-9b5f-a924637aa928" facs="#m-956d4a57-d2df-44df-a7f1-128743c08092" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia, allelúia. V. Posuísti. D. 1148.</l><l xml:id="m-500acd52-2360-4904-932e-13208d344dfe" facs="#m-1832aaba-92f0-4cc9-9a39-57a22058ef48" label="text-like">After Septuagesima, instead of the Alleluia. and its Verse, the Tract</l><l xml:id="m-bb40dda7-a979-4005-b45f-85a5e96681c1" facs="#m-99906f6a-5606-41ea-a6f4-571f7ed8db49" label="lyrics-like">Desidérium. is said as on p. 1131.</l><l xml:id="m-2677824b-062c-492f-8962-b82910ec2778" facs="#m-324e1c73-c177-4d00-846b-90287e1a63fb" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 1o.d.</l><l xml:id="m-470f5acf-1d80-4e34-9801-877ffac19b26" facs="#m-3653a400-d442-4be0-81e7-c2b03e19de4e" label="lyrics-like">IN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus di-me dignus. Qui invénit ánimam</l><l xml:id="m-891ad058-7d05-43e7-b372-b04c9639b653" facs="#m-0429f7e6-32fd-422f-9423-3853384ac5d7" label="lyrics-like">I scípulis suis: Nolite arbitrári suam, perdet illam: et qui perdi¬</l><l xml:id="m-d2627dad-00e5-4df6-b16f-a9cd0092c436" facs="#m-3f0ae0c9-52ea-446b-a1dd-b868a31cdfa8" label="lyrics-like">derit ánimam suam propter me,</l><l xml:id="m-d1111040-be59-4ae3-8635-08272dcfcf3e" facs="#m-24a028e9-3116-44b2-9959-c4704a39588e" label="lyrics-like">quia pacem vénerim mittere in ter¬</l><l xml:id="m-c80a0939-1d78-4c50-b900-6d95858c859c" facs="#m-1ad07c28-70bc-4a64-a8e8-6f0803ab6166" label="lyrics-like">invéniet eam. Qui récipit vos, me</l><l xml:id="m-57abcd94-f3f8-47fb-95d9-eb701c7d7d3f" facs="#m-ecc9cb36-887c-494a-87d8-64cd843aee0e" label="ambiguous">ram: non veni pacem mittere, sed</l><l xml:id="m-c0759348-f885-41b2-baf3-21a383b64119" facs="#m-b82de1b9-a25f-4728-b0f8-1bd2644771c7" label="lyrics-like">récipit: et qui me récipit, récipit</l><l xml:id="m-9bb4fac5-d766-472f-8055-c1651202cf72" facs="#m-286a9e58-321f-441a-a7eb-27feaea8a9e2" label="lyrics-like">gládium. Veni enim separâre hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-064e1a5d-cc98-4523-ae3a-25d4f0650e6a" facs="#m-7afbb3bd-b143-4fda-a823-dc85a20d7730" label="lyrics-like">eum qui me misit. Qui récipit pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-dee7a2da-1e9a-45e6-b2b1-2bfff783a392" facs="#m-1cbd84f3-3fb7-4247-901a-228f3f7e83f9" label="lyrics-like">minem advérsus patrem suum, et</l><l xml:id="m-49d31c05-b6c1-44d7-9ca2-145ee3396361" facs="#m-e266f8d8-df98-443e-9555-987fc276f0a7" label="lyrics-like">phétam in nómine prophétae, mer¬</l><l xml:id="m-20bf3031-f4d7-42e5-b7cb-81aec4f79baa" facs="#m-8c82e19b-e351-4c7c-b4c0-3abb55a3d07a" label="lyrics-like">filiam advérsus matrem suam, et</l><l xml:id="m-5a10d1eb-30ef-4a93-844d-5c27f1ae287a" facs="#m-59bd4ca1-a738-4d94-bd7f-7f4559aab932" label="lyrics-like">cédem prophétae accipiet: et qui</l><l xml:id="m-235531b0-d16a-415e-b9e4-77b2e38f2d94" facs="#m-8cd717c7-06ce-412f-8806-922fd2f3b6b4" label="lyrics-like">nurum advérsus socrum suam: et</l><l xml:id="m-c8dcbe42-47d7-4ebf-93c1-fa2c89f18922" facs="#m-3759b521-d5b8-4033-afb6-ccd4da354369" label="lyrics-like">récipit justum in nómine justi, mer¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ed2dcff-ce91-4a14-9989-1e213ae7d0fa" facs="#m-9f5db7c2-bca6-4b28-ba62-0dd35a59c343" label="lyrics-like">inimici hóminis, doméstici ejus. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-1141a36c-bbcb-4b14-853a-8e323ddda9e5" facs="#m-aeb128cd-c16d-4d55-bd7f-b4779f2d9ccc" label="lyrics-like">cédem justi accipiet. Et quicúmque</l><l xml:id="m-24df5e2c-c2f5-4a07-a2fd-46b225dd9df8" facs="#m-ae7ae3b2-1519-4ad6-8e01-9e3e524d9b35" label="ambiguous">amat patrem aut matrem plus quam</l><l xml:id="m-3ff6bd87-e070-4b88-844c-81c100b9781a" facs="#m-3fb2d6c4-53f6-489a-9c9d-1a24e0e2c92d" label="lyrics-like">potum déderit uni ex mínimis istis</l><l xml:id="m-de30c7fd-2be6-4fb5-b234-4d6d7f7e3237" facs="#m-573f3131-e81e-4a59-ad3e-11ff2bcb5eb3" label="ambiguous">me, non est me dignus: et qui amat</l><l xml:id="m-a7a33b06-4d0e-4db0-97a1-c1d0c377c911" facs="#m-56e0f246-d99b-4aac-94f4-1355177debba" label="lyrics-like">filium aut filiam super me, non est cálicem aquæ frígidae tantum in</l><l xml:id="m-d8d0048a-9932-4e89-b853-0eaa9c72e8e1" facs="#m-3dd05570-6346-41a8-9515-50be7e9fdd80" label="lyrics-like">me dignus. Et qui non áccipit cru¬</l><l xml:id="m-14a9cbf5-ddf9-47a1-a842-3bbf1d5c586d" facs="#m-579abb20-45f3-498f-8873-4edceead571e" label="lyrics-like">nómine discipuli ; amen dico vobis,</l><l xml:id="m-c3d9c57f-6630-42c2-9f48-397bebb12900" facs="#m-13dca1ec-3d7b-4212-9d9e-cae00ceb0083" label="lyrics-like">cem suam, et séquitur me, non est non perdet mercédem suam.</l><l xml:id="m-6b4ad1b2-9df0-4990-bc5b-ac225bd97065" facs="#m-bb5e781b-6e6b-4144-89e7-39ab19553663" label="ambiguous">ofrert.&amp;</l><l xml:id="m-8a9fa849-188a-491f-96f1-3c4e2fc2d594" facs="#m-41e3db75-ac22-4a97-8fdd-117308de3183" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-3d164f37-f566-4f85-8f89-1c34479c363e" facs="#m-b3544315-def1-42f4-8586-ac6bbac5c759" label="lyrics-like">GLó-ri- a "“et ho-nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-d67613f9-2c3a-4c46-abb8-2813448fd3c2" facs="#m-19b811eb-49f2-4e75-8fd7-d097c05b731b" label="ambiguous">re</l><l xml:id="m-3cd882bb-0660-44a9-bc00-4833235f52e5" facs="#m-671c9c0d-a88b-4244-90f3-e61f2dedb641" label="ambiguous">co-ro¬</l><l xml:id="m-30f3bba4-b3af-470f-964e-32d841469416" facs="#m-17a008d0-3bb6-4fd6-b476-513a6409c950" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-e10e0703-914a-4233-b46d-bea78fc3fb80" facs="#m-b6ea4d77-262d-452d-8301-c6ab110204b5" label="lyrics-like">ná- sti é¬ um : et consti¬ tu-i- sti</l><l xml:id="m-b33ce0d6-72a5-42ec-90ae-48363fc54525" facs="#m-7aa01495-d577-4cf7-8ee9-f6ad0c16c9c4" label="lyrics-like">má¬</l><l xml:id="m-78b5bc41-d661-4285-8ffd-35dec71834a4" facs="#m-e0affdfb-8a07-4912-9218-a147255dc67c" label="lyrics-like">nu-um tu-á¬</l><l xml:id="m-8cbb6520-1e09-470b-9f9f-24224dfb9b5f" facs="#m-338eb525-7fbd-4dfb-a97d-e27dd83b838a" label="lyrics-like">um super ó- pe¬ ra</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
